{"id":"696cc020-b384-4963-a45d-bb21901b94b0","title":"Lightspeed 3","slug":"lightspeed-3","collectionSlug":"lightspeed","collectionName":"Lightspeed","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic shader effect featuring multiple layered components creating a radial burst pattern against a dark background. The composition centers on a radial gradient transitioning from pure black at the core to a deep navy-purple (#14143b) at the edges, establishing a dark atmospheric foundation. Overlaid on this base are numerous rainbow-spectrum gradient elements arranged in a circular pattern radiating outward from the center. Each element displays a vertical color spectrum progressing through red, orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue, and purple bands. These spectral shapes appear as both cone-like and rectangular forms of varying sizes, with the larger elements positioned toward the outer edges and smaller ones concentrated near the center, creating a sense of depth and perspective. A zoom blur effect with high intensity (100) and jitter applied creates a radial motion blur emanating from the center point, giving the impression of rapid outward movement or explosion. The polar coordinates transformation warps the floating particles into a circular arrangement, while the overall blend mode and cineon tone mapping enhance contrast and saturation. The effect produces a kaleidoscopic, energetic appearance with strong chromatic separation and a sense of three-dimensional space despite the 2D composition. The dark background provides stark contrast to the vibrant, multicolored elements, emphasizing their luminosity and creating a dramatic, high-energy visual impact.","colors":["#ff0000","#ffff00","#00ffff","#0000ff","#14143b","#000000"],"labels":["gradient","glowing","vibrant","dramatic"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/696cc020-b384-4963-a45d-bb21901b94b0.jpg","toneMapping":"cineon","components":[{"type":"RadialGradient","id":"idmvhjnthn6kq0r4isz","_key":"key_mvhjnthn6kq